# Keeps the build context small and, more importantly, keeps local state out of the
# image: the development database and the media folder both contain real uploads.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/media-storage/
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
docs/
tests/
*.md
test.html
Start Website.bat
start-website.sh
